WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Chun-Li uses raw Drive Rush toward Juri.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.150
Rush back heavy punch connects as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.750
Medium Hazanshu follows the back-heavy hit.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.900
Crouching medium punch links after Hazanshu.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.250
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick finishes the punish.

6
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.550
Juri recovers after the Rush conversion.
